"Задайте :guilabel:`Color` (цвят), за да откроите продукта в :ref:`касовия "
"апарат на КТП <pos/use/open-register>`."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:90
msgid ""
"Enable :guilabel:`Available in Self Order` if the product can be ordered "
"in :doc:`self-ordering mode <extra/self_order>`. This option only appears "
"once the self-ordering mode is :ref:`enabled <pos/self_order/configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"Активирайте :guilabel:`Налично при самопоръчване`, ако продуктът може да "
"бъде поръчан в :doc:`режим на самопоръчване <extra/self_order>`. Тази опция "
"се показва само след като режимът за самопоръчване е :ref:`активиран <pos/"
"self_order/configuration>`."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:93
msgid ""
"Write a :guilabel:`Description` to display in the :ref:`product information "
"window in the POS register <pos/products/information-display>` and "
"in :doc:`self-ordering mode <extra/self_order>` when clicking the :icon:`fa-"
"info-circle` :ref:`info button <pos/products/tag-application>`."
msgstr ""
"Напишете :guilabel:`Description` (описание), което да се показва в "
":ref:`прозореца с информация за продукта в касовия апарат на КТП <pos/"
"products/information-display>` и в :doc:`режим на самостоятелна поръчка "
"<extra/self_order>` при щракване върху :icon:`fa-info-circle` :ref:`бутон за "
"информация <pos/products/tag-application>`."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:96
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Upsell & cross-sell` section, enable :guilabel:`POS "
"Optional Products` to suggest :doc:`optional products <../sales/"
"sales_quotations/optional_products>` when :ref:`adding items to the cart "
"<pos/use/sell>` in the POS register."
msgstr ""
"В раздела :guilabel:`Upsell & cross-sell` активирайте :guilabel:`POS "
"Optional Products`, за да предлагате :doc:`опционални продукти <../sales/"
"sales_quotations/optional_products>` при :ref:`добавяне на артикули в "
"количката <pos/use/sell>` в касовия апарат на КТП."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:99
msgid ""
"If applicable, configure :doc:`Urpan Piper <restaurant/urban_piper>` and/or "
"decide if the product is :guilabel:`Available for Platform Orders`, such as "
"GrabFood or GoFood."
msgstr ""
"Ако е приложимо, конфигурирайте :doc:`Urpan Piper <restaurant/urban_piper>` "
"и/или решете дали продуктът е :guilabel:`Available for Platform Orders`, "
"като GrabFood или GoFood."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:102
msgid ""
"Above that, you can configure additional options, such as :ref:`product "
"variants <pos/products/variants>`, :ref:`product tags <pos/products/"
"tags>`, :ref:`product and category images display <pos/products/images>`, "
"and :ref:`units of measure <pos/products/units>`."
msgstr ""
"Над това можете да конфигурирате допълнителни опции, като :ref:`продуктови "
"варианти <pos/products/variants>`, :ref:`продуктови етикети <pos/products/"
"tags>`, :ref:`показване на изображения на продукти и категории <pos/products/"
"images>` и :ref:`мерни единици <pos/products/units>`."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:109
#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:136
#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:164
#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:3
#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:218
msgid "Product variants"
msgstr "Продуктови варианти"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:111
msgid ""
"To allow the use of different product variants, go "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to "
"the :guilabel:`Products`, enable :guilabel:`Variants`, and :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"За да разрешите използването на различни продуктови варианти, отидете на "
":menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Settings`, превъртете надолу "
"до :guilabel:`Products`, активирайте :guilabel:`Variants` и щракнете върху "
":guilabel:`Save`."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:116
msgid ""
"The **Inventory** app is automatically installed when using the **Point of "
"Sale** app."
msgstr ""
"Приложението **Inventory** се инсталира автоматично при използване на "
"приложението **Point of Sale**."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:118
msgid ""
"Then, navigate to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Products --> Products`, "
"select a product, and configure :ref:`attributes <products/variants/"
"attributes>` and their :ref:`values <products/variants/attributes-values>` "
"to create :ref:`variants <products/variants/variants>` in "
"the :guilabel:`Attributes & Variants` tab. On the value's form, "
"enable :guilabel:`Available on Food Delivery` for values available through "
"delivery platforms, if applicable."
msgstr ""
"След това отидете на :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Products --> "
"Products`, изберете продукт и конфигурирайте :ref:`атрибути <products/"
"variants/attributes>` и техните :ref:`стойности <products/variants/"
"attributes-values>`, за да създадете :ref:`варианти <products/variants/"
"variants>` в раздела :guilabel:`Attributes & Variants`. Във формуляра на "
"стойността активирайте :guilabel:`Available on Food Delivery` за стойности, "
"налични чрез платформи за доставка, ако е приложимо."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:125
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Configuration --> Attributes` "
"to manage all configured attributes, or to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> "
"Products --> Product Variants` to view all variants."
msgstr ""
"Отидете на :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Configuration --> Attributes`, "
"за да управлявате всички конфигурирани атрибути, или на "
":menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Products --> Product Variants`, за да "
"видите всички варианти."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:131
msgid ""
"Users in the :ref:`POS register <pos/use/open-register>` and customers "
"in :doc:`self-ordering mode <extra/self_order>` can select product variants "
"when :ref:`adding items to the cart <pos/use/sell>`."
msgstr ""
"Потребителите в :ref:`касовия апарат на КТП <pos/use/open-register>` и "
"клиентите в :doc:`режим на самостоятелна поръчка <extra/self_order>` могат "
"да избират продуктови варианти при :ref:`добавяне на артикули в количката "
"<pos/use/sell>`."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:0
msgid "Example of product variants in self-ordering mode."
msgstr "Пример за продуктови варианти в режим на самостоятелна поръчка."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:142
msgid "Product Tags"
msgstr "Продуктови етикети"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:144
msgid ""
"Product tags help highlight specific features in :doc:`self-ordering mode "
"<extra/self_order>`. To create product tags, go to :menuselection:`Point of "
"Sale --> Configuration --> Product Tags`. On the :guilabel:`Product Tags` "
"page, click :guilabel:`New` or select an existing tag."
msgstr ""
"Продуктовите етикети помагат да се откроят конкретни характеристики в "
":doc:`режим на самостоятелна поръчка <extra/self_order>`. За да създадете "
"продуктови етикети, отидете на :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> "
"Configuration --> Product Tags`. На страницата :guilabel:`Product Tags` "
"щракнете върху :guilabel:`New` или изберете съществуващ етикет."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:149
msgid "On the product tag form:"
msgstr "Във формуляра за продуктов етикет:"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:151
msgid "Enter a :guilabel:`Tag` label."
msgstr "Въведете етикет :guilabel:`Tag`."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:152
msgid ""
"Enable/disable :guilabel:`Visible to customers` to control whether the tag "
"is visible to customers in :doc:`self-ordering mode <extra/self_order>`."
msgstr ""
"Активирайте/деактивирайте :guilabel:`Visible to customers`, за да "
"контролирате дали етикетът е видим за клиентите в :doc:`режим на "
"самостоятелна поръчка <extra/self_order>`."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:154
msgid ""
"Optionally, choose a :guilabel:`Color` or add an image. If both are "
"configured, the image replaces the tag's color."
msgstr ""
"По желание изберете :guilabel:`Color` (цвят) или добавете изображение. Ако и "
"двете са конфигурирани, изображението заменя цвета на етикета."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:156
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Point of sale` section, write a description to be shown in "
"self-ordering mode."
msgstr ""
"В раздела :guilabel:`Point of sale` напишете описание, което да се показва в "
"режим на самостоятелна поръчка."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:158
msgid ""
"To add tags to a product, navigate to the product form, go to "
"the :guilabel:`Sales` tab, and, in the :guilabel:`Extra info` section, add "
"as many :guilabel:`Tags` as needed."
msgstr ""
"За да добавите етикети към продукт, отидете във формуляра на продукта, "
"преминете към раздела :guilabel:`Sales` и в секцията :guilabel:`Extra info` "
"добавете колкото :guilabel:`Tags` е необходимо."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:162
msgid ""
"If the **eCommerce** app is installed, :ref:`tags <ecommerce/catalog/"
"filters>` are used in both apps, and need to be added in "
"the :guilabel:`Ecommerce shop` section of the :guilabel:`Sales` tab."
msgstr ""
"Ако приложението **eCommerce** е инсталирано, :ref:`етикетите <ecommerce/"
"catalog/filters>` се използват в двете приложения и трябва да бъдат добавени "
"в секцията :guilabel:`Ecommerce shop` на раздела :guilabel:`Sales`."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:170
msgid ""
"Tags are displayed only in :doc:`self-ordering mode <extra/self_order>`, "
"*not* in the :ref:`POS register <pos/use/open-register>`. Customers can view "
"the tags and tag descriptions by clicking the :icon:`fa-"
"info` :guilabel:`(info)` icon next to the product name."
msgstr ""
"Етикетите се показват само в :doc:`режим на самостоятелна поръчка <extra/"
"self_order>`, *не* в :ref:`касовия апарат на КТП <pos/use/open-register>`. "
"Клиентите могат да видят етикетите и техните описания, като щракнат върху "
"иконата :icon:`fa-info` :guilabel:`(info)` до името на продукта."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:0
msgid "Example of product tags in self-ordering mode."
msgstr "Пример за продуктови етикети в режим на самостоятелна поръчка."

