#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:97
msgid ":guilabel:`Create on Order`: select :guilabel:`Nothing`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Create on Order`: изберете :guilabel:`Nothing`"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:37
msgid ":guilabel:`Sales Price`: enter the amount of the top-up"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Sales Price`: въведете сумата на зареждането"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:40
msgid ""
"In order to have eWallet top-ups of different amounts, create multiple top-"
"up products and modify the :guilabel:`Sales Price` accordingly."
msgstr ""
"За да имате зареждания на електронен портфейл в различни суми, създайте "
"няколко продукта за зареждане и променете съответно :guilabel:`Sales Price`."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:43
msgid ""
"Once the top-up is created, go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --> "
